  "name" : "Hansen2019 - Nine species reduced model of blood coagulation",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>its a nine species reduced model of Hockin 2002. Model uses different level of reduction (5,7,9,11) and testing the best alignment with Hockin model results</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
